The Hand-over
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[Write this from real life.]&lt;/strong&gt; What was the first question she asked? What broke or surprised her? Which topic did the weak-topics list flag that she hadn't realized was weak? What did she say at the end, word for word?&lt;/p&gt;




