&lt;h2&gt;


What I Built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built &lt;strong&gt;Student Expense AI&lt;/strong&gt; for a college friend who struggles to track daily expenses.&lt;br&gt;
Instead of manually adding every expense, they can simply type:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;"I spent ₹180 on lunch today."&lt;br&gt;
The AI understands the expense, categorizes it, and helps track budgets and spending.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

