&lt;h2&gt;


How I Built It
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Built with &lt;strong&gt;React, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and Gemma&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
Gemma is used for:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expense categorization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural-language expense entry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI expense assistant
I also use &lt;strong&gt;Gemini API&lt;/strong&gt; for additional features like receipt analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Why Does Open Innovation Matter?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Using open-weight &lt;strong&gt;Gemma&lt;/strong&gt; gives the project more flexibility and allows the core AI functionality to run without depending entirely on a closed AI API.&lt;/p&gt;

